{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_20011","headline":"自商行谒复州卢使君虔 · 孟郊","name":"自商行谒复州卢使君虔","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"一身遶千山，远作行路人。\n未遂东吴归，暂出西京尘。\n仲宣荆州客，今余竟陵宾。\n往蹟虽不同，托意皆有因。\n商岭莓苔滑，石坂上下频。\n江汉沙泥洁，永日光景新。\n独泪起残夜，孤吟望初晨。\n驱驰竟何事，章句依深仁。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"孟郊","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_20011.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_20011","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}